<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>成年人读写障碍筛查量表</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #1a1410;
    --paper: #f5f0e8;
    --warm: #e8dcc8;
    --accent: #8b2e2e;
    --accent2: #3d5a6e;
    --mid: #7a6e5f;
    --light: #d4c9b4;
    --green: #3a6b4a;
    --amber: #c17a2a;
  }

- { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
background: var(–paper);
color: var(–ink);
font-family: ‘Noto Sans SC’, serif;
min-height: 100vh;
background-image:
radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, rgba(139,46,46,0.06) 0%, transparent 50%),
radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%, rgba(61,90,110,0.06) 0%, transparent 50%);
}

.header {
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–paper);
padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem;
text-align: center;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
}

.header::before {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
inset: 0;
background: repeating-linear-gradient(
90deg,
transparent,
transparent 60px,
rgba(245,240,232,0.03) 60px,
rgba(245,240,232,0.03) 61px
);
}

.header-badge {
display: inline-block;
border: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.3);
padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
font-size: 0.7rem;
letter-spacing: 0.15em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–light);
margin-bottom: 1rem;
font-family: ‘Noto Sans SC’, sans-serif;
font-weight: 300;
}

.header h1 {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem);
font-weight: 600;
letter-spacing: 0.05em;
line-height: 1.4;
position: relative;
}

.header p {
margin-top: 0.8rem;
font-size: 0.82rem;
color: var(–light);
font-weight: 300;
letter-spacing: 0.03em;
position: relative;
}

.container {
max-width: 760px;
margin: 0 auto;
padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
}

.intro-card {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
border-left: 4px solid var(–accent2);
padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
margin-bottom: 2rem;
border-radius: 2px;
}

.intro-card h3 {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 0.9rem;
color: var(–accent2);
margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
font-weight: 600;
}

.intro-card p, .intro-card li {
font-size: 0.82rem;
color: var(–mid);
line-height: 1.8;
}

.intro-card ul {
padding-left: 1.2rem;
margin-top: 0.4rem;
}

.section {
margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.section-header {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 0.8rem;
margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
border-bottom: 2px solid var(–warm);
}

.section-num {
width: 32px;
height: 32px;
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–paper);
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
font-size: 0.75rem;
font-weight: 600;
letter-spacing: 0.05em;
flex-shrink: 0;
}

.section-title {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 1rem;
font-weight: 600;
color: var(–ink);
}

.section-subtitle {
font-size: 0.75rem;
color: var(–mid);
margin-top: 0.15rem;
}

.question {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
border-radius: 2px;
padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}

.question:hover {
border-color: var(–accent2);
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(61,90,110,0.08);
}

.question.answered {
border-left: 3px solid var(–green);
}

.q-text {
font-size: 0.875rem;
line-height: 1.75;
color: var(–ink);
margin-bottom: 1rem;
font-weight: 400;
}

.q-num {
display: inline-block;
color: var(–accent);
font-weight: 600;
margin-right: 0.4rem;
font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.options {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
gap: 0.5rem;
}

.options.binary {
grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
max-width: 280px;
}

.opt-btn {
padding: 0.5rem 0.3rem;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
background: var(–paper);
color: var(–mid);
font-size: 0.75rem;
font-family: ‘Noto Sans SC’, sans-serif;
cursor: pointer;
border-radius: 1px;
transition: all 0.15s;
text-align: center;
line-height: 1.4;
}

.opt-btn:hover {
border-color: var(–accent2);
color: var(–accent2);
background: rgba(61,90,110,0.05);
}

.opt-btn.selected {
background: var(–accent2);
border-color: var(–accent2);
color: white;
font-weight: 500;
}

.scale-labels {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
font-size: 0.68rem;
color: var(–mid);
margin-top: 0.4rem;
padding: 0 0.2rem;
}

.submit-area {
text-align: center;
margin-top: 3rem;
padding-top: 2rem;
border-top: 1px solid var(–warm);
}

.progress-bar {
background: var(–warm);
height: 4px;
border-radius: 2px;
margin-bottom: 1rem;
overflow: hidden;
}

.progress-fill {
height: 100%;
background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(–accent2), var(–green));
transition: width 0.4s ease;
border-radius: 2px;
}

.progress-text {
font-size: 0.78rem;
color: var(–mid);
margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.btn-submit {
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–paper);
border: none;
padding: 1rem 3rem;
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 1rem;
font-weight: 600;
letter-spacing: 0.08em;
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.2s;
border-radius: 1px;
}

.btn-submit:hover:not(:disabled) {
background: var(–accent);
transform: translateY(-1px);
box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(139,46,46,0.3);
}

.btn-submit:disabled {
opacity: 0.4;
cursor: not-allowed;
}

/* RESULTS */
#results {
display: none;
}

.result-header {
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–paper);
padding: 2rem;
text-align: center;
margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.result-header h2 {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 1.3rem;
font-weight: 600;
margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.score-display {
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
gap: 2rem;
margin: 1.5rem 0;
flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.score-box {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
padding: 1.2rem 1.6rem;
text-align: center;
min-width: 120px;
}

.score-box .num {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 2.2rem;
font-weight: 700;
line-height: 1;
}

.score-box .label {
font-size: 0.72rem;
color: var(–mid);
margin-top: 0.4rem;
letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.score-box.total .num { color: var(–accent); }
.score-box.level .num { font-size: 1.1rem; }

.level-bar-wrap {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
padding: 1.4rem;
margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.level-bar-title {
font-size: 0.8rem;
color: var(–mid);
margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.level-track {
height: 12px;
background: var(–warm);
border-radius: 6px;
overflow: hidden;
margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.level-fill {
height: 100%;
border-radius: 6px;
transition: width 1s ease;
}

.level-fill.low { background: var(–green); }
.level-fill.mid { background: var(–amber); }
.level-fill.high { background: var(–accent); }

.level-marks {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
font-size: 0.65rem;
color: var(–mid);
}

.dimension-results {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 1rem;
margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.dim-card {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
}

.dim-card h4 {
font-size: 0.78rem;
color: var(–mid);
margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
font-weight: 500;
}

.dim-score-bar {
height: 6px;
background: var(–warm);
border-radius: 3px;
overflow: hidden;
margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}

.dim-fill {
height: 100%;
border-radius: 3px;
background: var(–accent2);
transition: width 1s ease;
}

.dim-card .pct {
font-size: 0.72rem;
color: var(–accent2);
font-weight: 500;
}

.interpretation {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
border-left: 4px solid var(–accent);
padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.interpretation h3 {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 0.95rem;
color: var(–accent);
margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.interpretation p {
font-size: 0.83rem;
line-height: 1.9;
color: var(–ink);
}

.recommendations {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–light);
padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.recommendations h3 {
font-family: ‘Noto Serif SC’, serif;
font-size: 0.95rem;
color: var(–accent2);
margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.rec-item {
display: flex;
gap: 0.8rem;
margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
align-items: flex-start;
}

.rec-icon {
width: 20px;
height: 20px;
background: var(–accent2);
color: white;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
font-size: 0.6rem;
flex-shrink: 0;
margin-top: 0.1rem;
}

.rec-text {
font-size: 0.82rem;
line-height: 1.7;
color: var(–ink);
}

.disclaimer {
background: rgba(193,122,42,0.08);
border: 1px solid rgba(193,122,42,0.3);
padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
border-radius: 2px;
margin-top: 1.5rem;
}

.disclaimer p {
font-size: 0.75rem;
color: var(–amber);
line-height: 1.7;
}

.btn-retry {
background: transparent;
color: var(–mid);
border: 1px solid var(–light);
padding: 0.7rem 2rem;
font-family: ‘Noto Sans SC’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.82rem;
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.2s;
margin-top: 1.5rem;
}

.btn-retry:hover {
border-color: var(–ink);
color: var(–ink);
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
.options { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
.dimension-results { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.score-display { gap: 1rem; }
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div id="assessment">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-badge">心理筛查工具 · 专业版</div>
    <h1>成年人读写障碍筛查量表</h1>
    <p>Adult Dyslexia Screening Assessment · 参考 DAST / BDA Adult Checklist 标准</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-card">
      <h3>📋 使用说明</h3>
      <p>本量表适用于18岁以上成年人，共涵盖<strong>6个维度、35道题目</strong>，用于初步筛查读写障碍相关症状。请根据您的<strong>实际日常体验</strong>作答，不存在对错之分。</p>
      <ul>
        <li>题目1–25：频率量表（从不 → 总是）</li>
        <li>题目26–35：是/否选择</li>
        <li>完成全部题目后点击"生成报告"</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

```
<!-- 维度一 -->
<div class="section" id="sec1">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">01</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">阅读与文字识别</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估对书面文字的识别与理解能力</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q1">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">1.</span>在阅读时，您是否会无意中跳行、重复读同一行，或者丢失阅读位置？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="1" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q2">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">2.</span>阅读时，您是否感觉文字在纸上"移动"、模糊或重叠？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="2" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q3">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">3.</span>读完一段文字后，您是否经常记不住刚才读了什么内容？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="3" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q4">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">4.</span>在朗读时，您是否经常读错、跳字，或将相似字词弄混（如"己"和"已"）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="4" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q5">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">5.</span>与同龄人相比，您的阅读速度是否明显偏慢，或需要反复阅读才能理解？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="5" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 维度二 -->
<div class="section" id="sec2">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">02</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">书写与拼写</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估文字书写、字形记忆与拼写能力</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q6">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">6.</span>书写时，您是否常常写出字形错误的字（笔画多或少、结构颠倒）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="6" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q7">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">7.</span>即使知道一个字的读音，您是否仍难以想起怎么书写它？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="7" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q8">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">8.</span>您是否会将字母或部首的方向写反（如"b/d"、"6/9"）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="8" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q9">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">9.</span>写文章或邮件时，即使内容想清楚了，是否也很难把它们准确表达成书面文字？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="9" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 维度三 -->
<div class="section" id="sec3">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">03</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">语音处理与听觉</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估语音意识、音节处理与听觉记忆</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q10">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">10.</span>您是否觉得很难把一个词按音节拆分，或者辨认出押韵的词？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="10" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q11">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">11.</span>听别人说一长串信息（如电话号码、地址）时，您是否容易记混或遗漏？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="11" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q12">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">12.</span>您是否在嘈杂环境中特别难以听清别人说的话，比其他人更明显？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="12" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q13">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">13.</span>您是否常常会把听到的词"听错"，将其理解为发音相似的另一个词？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="13" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 维度四 -->
<div class="section" id="sec4">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">04</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">工作记忆与信息处理</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估短时记忆、顺序处理与认知负荷</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q14">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">14.</span>您是否在做事时容易忘记刚才看过或听过的信息（如忘记菜谱步骤、被打断后不知道做到哪步）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="14" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q15">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">15.</span>您是否难以记住一串数字（如手机号、账号），需要反复查看？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="15" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q16">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">16.</span>同时处理多项任务时，您是否常感到思维混乱或其中一项任务的信息"消失"了？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="16" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q17">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">17.</span>您是否经常在说话中途忘记原本想说的词，只能用"那个……就是那个"来代替？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="17" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q18">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">18.</span>您是否难以记住日期、约定事项或时间表，即使已经记录也难以想起？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="18" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 维度五 -->
<div class="section" id="sec5">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">05</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">方向感与空间处理</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估左右辨别、序列顺序与空间定向</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q19">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">19.</span>您是否经常混淆"左"和"右"，或需要停顿想一下才能分辨？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="19" data-dim="spatial"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q20">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">20.</span>在按顺序排列事物时（如按字母、时间顺序），您是否觉得特别困难？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="20" data-dim="spatial"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="q21">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">21.</span>即使在熟悉的地方，您是否也容易迷路或记不住路线？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="21" data-dim="spatial"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
